In twos. Give every Pantheon view a twin you can inspect beside it.

Principle	First	Second
Version control	Parent revision	Proposed revision
Probability	Leading interpretation	Strongest plausible alternative
Immutability	Original capture	Tamper-evident record of how the view was made

Put a swap button between the two views. Same scale, same evidence, same display settings. If the other interpretation suddenly feels more convincing just because it’s in front, you’ve learned something about the presentation. Both interpretations keep their original confidence when you swap them.